    "updated_at": "2026-09-29T16:51:38Z",
    "body": "I would argue that it would make sense to solidify the behavior to not jump back when paused, since the spec's current behavior causes the last frame to be shown briefly before it changes to the ~~last~~ first frame while scrubbing to the end of the media.",
